[node name="DoorInteriorBath" type="Node3D"]
metadata/_doc = "Interior door: painted frame and 40 mm leaf (0.85 x 2.07 m) for a 0.90 x 2.10 m opening in a 0.20 m wall. Origin = bottom center of the opening on the wall's center plane; the leaf opens toward +Z (0..100 degrees), hinge on the -X jamb. Levers at 1.1 m on both faces. Grab a lever to swing it; let go while moving and it swings on; the latch catches it within 3 degrees of closed. Privacy thumb-turn on the +Z face (inside, the swing side), coin release on the -Z face. Built by blender/props/door_interior/ (D-026)."

